16:24:08  == Installing ClaudeOS next to macOS
16:24:08  The Asahi installer makes room next to macOS and installs ClaudeOS's base (Fedora Linux) there. Setup
16:24:08  answers its questions. When it asks for your Mac's password, type it (it stays hidden) and press Enter.
16:24:08  It takes about 10 to 20 minutes; your Mac may seem to freeze while macOS's partition shrinks. That's normal.
16:24:08  First, your Mac's password for setup itself:
16:24:10  STOPPED The Asahi installer didn't finish (see above; its log is /tmp/claudeos-ci.v8T2ZK/work/asahi-installer.log). If it made room or partitions, run setup again and choose "Remove ClaudeOS from this Mac" to clean up.
